{"id":"115b0689f1a67703","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-consistency-strength-hierarchy.md","title":"Consistency Strength Hierarchy","display":"thm-consistency-strength-hierarchy — Consistency Strength Hierarchy","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-consistency-strength-hierarchy","aliases":["92-thm-consistency-strength-hierarchy"],"display":"thm-consistency-strength-hierarchy — Consistency Strength Hierarchy","depends_on":["[[92-df-iterated-consistency]]","[[92-df-consistency-statement]]","[[92-df-recursive-axiomatization]]","[[92-df-theory-set]]","[[92-df-theory-system]]","[[92-thm-second-incompleteness]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-consistency-strength-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-consistency-strength-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-consistency-strength-hierarchy — Consistency Strength Hierarchy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3ccc8054e82f6b5d\" href=\"?note=3ccc8054e82f6b5d\" title=\"92-df-iterated-consistency\">92-df-iterated-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"68f172d58c15e75d\" href=\"?note=68f172d58c15e75d\" title=\"92-df-consistency-statement\">92-df-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2f9850d6fe4ddc35\" href=\"?note=2f9850d6fe4ddc35\" title=\"92-df-recursive-axiomatization\">92-df-recursive-axiomatization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"975b3aa9a1e08797\" href=\"?note=975b3aa9a1e08797\" title=\"92-df-theory-set\">92-df-theory-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"09b80989dbe14044\" href=\"?note=09b80989dbe14044\" title=\"92-df-theory-system\">92-df-theory-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"57ea3ea286817df3\" href=\"?note=57ea3ea286817df3\" title=\"92-thm-second-incompleteness\">92-thm-second-incompleteness</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T^{(n)})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((T^{(n)})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (iterated consistency theories, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3ccc8054e82f6b5d\" href=\"?note=3ccc8054e82f6b5d\" title=\"92-df-iterated-consistency\">92-df-iterated-consistency</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)=\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T^{(n)})}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)=\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T^{(n)})}\\)</span> (internal consistency sentence for stage <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T^{(n)})\">\\(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T^{(n)})\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T^{(n)}))\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T^{(n)}))\\)</span> (canonical presentation and its external consistency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T^{(n)})\">\\(\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T^{(n)})\\)</span> (recursive axiomatizability)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\subseteq T^{(n)}\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\subseteq T^{(n)}\\)</span> (each stage extends the full theorem set of the fixed PA system, hence has sufficient arithmetic strength)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}strength\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\Bigl[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\subseteq T^{(n)}\\land\n\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T^{(n)})\\land\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T^{(n)}))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(1)\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(T^{(n)}\\subsetneq T^{(n+1)}),\\\\\n&amp;(2)\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T^{(n)})\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;(3)\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T^{(n+1)})\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}strength\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\Bigl[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\subseteq T^{(n)}\\land\n\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T^{(n)})\\land\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T^{(n)}))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(1)\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(T^{(n)}\\subsetneq T^{(n+1)}),\\\\\n&amp;(2)\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T^{(n)})\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;(3)\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T^{(n+1)})\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>一致性强度层级：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_0 &lt; G_1 &lt; G_2 &lt; \\ldots\">\\(G_0 &lt; G_1 &lt; G_2 &lt; \\ldots\\)</span></li>\n<li>在每一层都相容、递归可公理化且扩张固定PA理论<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span>的明确前提下，第二不完备性使每层严格强于前一层；仅含<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>一般不足以支持第二不完备性的内部化</li>\n<li>但每层仍不完备（不能证明自身一致性）</li>\n<li>这是Gödel的&quot;一致性层级&quot;理论</li>\n<li>Turing研究了这种层级的极限</li>\n<li>仅由基理论相容不能无条件推出所有后继层相容；这里把逐层相容性作为显式前提</li>\n<li>原断言关于任意<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&lt;m\">\\(n&lt;m\\)</span>都不能证明后层一致性的第(4)项还需要在早期层内形式化各呈现之间的证明翻译与相容性单调性，故不把它作为前三项的无条件附带结论</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-iterated-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"3ccc8054e82f6b5d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-iterated-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"68f172d58c15e75d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistency-statement]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-axiomatization","status":"resolved","id":"2f9850d6fe4ddc35","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-axiomatization]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-set","status":"resolved","id":"975b3aa9a1e08797","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-system","status":"resolved","id":"09b80989dbe14044","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-second-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"57ea3ea286817df3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-second-incompleteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-iterated-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"3ccc8054e82f6b5d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(T^{(n)})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}$ (iterated consistency theories, see [[92-df-iterated-consistency]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(T^{(n)})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)=\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T^{(n)})}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T^{(n)})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T^{(n)}))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T^{(n)})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\subseteq T^{(n)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}strength\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\Bigl[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\subseteq T^{(n)}\\land\n\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T^{(n)})\\land\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T^{(n)}))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\begin{aligned}\n&(1)\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(T^{(n)}\\subsetneq T^{(n+1)}),\\\\\n&(2)\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T^{(n)})\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)\\bigr),\\\\\n&(3)\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T^{(n+1)})\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"G_0 < G_1 < G_2 < \\ldots","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"n<m","display":false}],"bytes":2398,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-158","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-ce-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-ch-independence.md]]\n[[92-thm-compactness.md]]\n[[92-thm-completeness-fo.md]]\n[[92-thm-consistency-addable.md]]\n[[92-thm-consistency-strength-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-thm-craig-theorem.md]]\n[[92-thm-deduction-theorem.md]]\n[[92-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[92-thm-essentially-undecidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-first-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-godel-incompleteness-general.md]]\n[[92-thm-godel-set-undecidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-halting-undecidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-incompleteness-recursive-extension.md]]\n[[92-thm-induction-axiom-decidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-k-g-equivalent.md]]\n[[92-thm-lob-theorem.md]]\n[[92-thm-m-complete-creative.md]]\n[[92-thm-numeral-injective.md]]\n[[92-thm-omega-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-pairing-bijective.md]]\n[[92-thm-pi1-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-pr-representable-detailed.md]]\n[[92-thm-pr-representable.md]]\n[[92-thm-reflection-undecidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-reflection-unprovable.md]]\n[[92-thm-representability.md]]\n[[92-thm-representation-strong.md]]\n[[92-thm-rice-theorem-arithmetic.md]]\n[[92-thm-rosser-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-schema-axiom-decidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-second-incompleteness.md]]